   "type": "DOCUMENT",
   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANS201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13464 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">ANS201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13464 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>'- Attend at least 80% of contact hours in order to be accepted to the final examination<br>- Actively participate in class activities<br>- Fulfill tasks given by instructor after class<br>- Use their own laptop in class only for learning purpose<br>- Read the textbook in advance &gt;<br>- Access the course website (<a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a>) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>'- Attend at least 80% of contact hours in order to be accepted to the final examination<br>- Actively participate in class activities<br>- Fulfill tasks given by instructor after class<br>- Use their own laptop in class only for learning purpose<br>- Read the textbook in advance &gt;<br>- Access the course website (<a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a>) for up-to-date information and material of the course, for online supports from teachers and other students and for practicing and assessment.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions (30)</h3>\n<p>Questions the syllabus asks you to think through before or during the session — try answering them yourself first.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo (30)</h3>\n<p>Câu hỏi syllabus yêu cầu bạn suy nghĩ trước/trong buổi học — tự trả lời trước khi xem bài.</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>Session<br><small>Buổi</small></th><th>Code<br><small>Mã</small></th><th>Question (verbatim)<br><small>Câu hỏi (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>QN4.1</td><td>What are the diffrence between a script and a literature work?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td>QN5.1</td><td>What is an original script and an adapted script?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td>QN6.1</td><td>What is a cinematography script?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td>QN7.1</td><td>What is a screenplays?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td>QN8.1</td><td>What is an original screenplays?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td>QN9.1</td><td>How are scripts and literary works similar and different?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td>QN10.1</td><td>What is an idea development?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td>QN11.1</td><td>What's your piece about?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td>QN12.1</td><td>How to steps to turn an idea into a script?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td>QN13.1</td><td>What's a movie tagline?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>14</td><td>QN14.1</td><td>What is Srcipt analysis?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>15</td><td>QN15.1</td><td>What is a script structure?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>22</td><td>QN22.1</td><td>&quot;I know there is a planet, on which there is a man with a red face. He never smelled a flower. Never looked at a star. Never loved anyone. he never did anything other than additions calculations. And all day long he kept repeating as he did: &quot;I am a right man! I am a right man!&quot;, and that made him snobbish. But he's not human, he's a mushroom!&quot;<br>What will the script of the above passage look like?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>23</td><td>QN23.1</td><td>What is the 3 act structure?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>24</td><td>QN24.1</td><td>Choose a short film that you know. How do you analyze the 3-act structure of that movie?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>28</td><td>QN28.1</td><td>What impressed you in the film?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>29</td><td>QN29.1</td><td>What is the 4W method?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>30</td><td>QN30.1</td><td>How do you feel 4W method?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>37</td><td>QN37.1</td><td>What is The 5 Key Turning Points (Michael Hauge)</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>38</td><td>QN38.1</td><td>How to write a script in a standard format.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>39</td><td>QN39.1</td><td>How to build a character for the script?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>43</td><td>QN43.1</td><td>Which character do you like the most?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>44</td><td>QN44.1</td><td>Why do you like this character?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>45</td><td>QN45.1</td><td>What is character used for?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>46</td><td>QN46.1</td><td>What is TVC?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>47</td><td>QN47.1</td><td>Which TVC do you like the most?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>48</td><td>QN48.1</td><td>How is Procedures to produce a TVC?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>52</td><td>QN52.1</td><td>What role does the script play in TVC?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>53</td><td>QN53.1</td><td>How to make TVC successful?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>54</td><td>QN54.1</td><td>What message do you want to convey in the group's tvc</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13464\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13464</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13464\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13464</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
